fforts to form the group, μ's.\n\nA while later, Maki Nishikino, a songwriter, Hanayo Koizumi, who always dreamed of being a school idol, Rin Hoshizora, Hanayo's friend, and Nico Yazawa, the president of the Idol Study Club, joined the group, all with the aim of entering the school idol festival, Love Live.\n\nAdditionally, Eli Ayase, the student council president, and Nozomi Tojo, the student council vice president, joined μ's, bringing the group to a total of nine members. After overcoming many problems, ranging from the closing of the school to Kotori's study-abroad incident to μ's going on hiatus, what will the girls aim for next!?\n\n(Source: NIS America)"},"tags":[{"name":"Idol","rank":99,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dancing","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cute Girls Doing Cute Things","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tomboy","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shrine Maiden","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":45,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bowling","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Love Live! School Idol Project 2nd Season","english":"Love Live! School Idol Project 2nd Season","native":"ラブライブ! School idol project 2期","romaji":"Love Live! School idol project 2nd Season","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"ラブライブ! 第2期"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"Love Live! 第二季"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"ラブライブ! School idol project 第2期"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}